SUMMARY: From Balconies to Backyards: Planning a Successful Vegetable Gar
 den
DESCRIPTION:Want to enjoy vegetables you've grown yourself in your own ba
 ckyard or on your balcony? A Toronto Master Gardener will lead a demonstr
 ation and show you how to get started to grow your own vegetables. Get so
 me tips and learn techniques for successful growing. At the end of the de
 mo\, vegetable seeds or seedlings will be given out to attendees\, while 
 supplies last.\n\nPlease register online at www.tpl.ca http://www.tpl.ca\
 n\nWednesday\, April 29 from 2pm - 3pm\n\nMalvern Branch\, Toronto Public
  Library\n\n30 Sewells Road\n\n(416) 396-8969
