SUMMARY: DEEN Open House
DESCRIPTION:We would like to personally invite you and your team to an Op
 en House at DEEN Support Services\, where we'll be sharing more about the
  programs and supports we offer to individuals with disabilities and thei
 r families in our community.\n\nWhether you work with newcomers\, settlem
 ent services\, or other community supports\, we believe there are meaning
 ful opportunities for connection and collaboration — and we'd love the ch
 ance to meet you in person!\n\n\n📅 Date: Thursday\, April 30th\n\n🕙 Tim
 e: 11:00 AM – 2:00 PM\n\n📍 Location: Sheridan Mall - 2225 Erin Mills Par
 kway\, we are located at the back side of the mall\, down the sidewalk fr
 om Sheridan Library. We are at Gate 13 and can be accessed via parking lo
 t off of Fowler Drive.\n\nLight refreshments will be served!\n\nHere's a 
 little about what we do:\n\n*Day Program for Adults (21+): A structured\,
  engaging day program for adults with intellectual disabilities\, focused
  on skill-building\, community participation\, and quality of life.\n\n*S
 upport Networks: Dedicated support groups and resources for caregivers\, 
 siblings\, and family members navigating the disability journey as well a
 s peer networks for individuals living with physical disabilities or visi
 on loss.\n\n*Modified sports programming for youth and adults with intell
 ectual disabilities - registrations currently open!\n\n*Tech training\, s
 ystem navigation\, crisis support\, advocacy support among other services
  and events!\n\nLight refreshments will be served\, and our team will be 
 on hand to answer questions\, share resources\, and explore how we might 
 work together to better serve the people in your community.\n\nPlease RSV
 P by replying to this email as soon as possible to help us prepare!\n\nWe
  truly look forward to welcoming you!
CATEGORIES:Community
X-TKF-CUSTOM-PREVIEW:We would like to personally invite you and your team
  to an Open House at DEEN Support Services\, where we'll be sharing more 
 about the programs and supports...
LOCATION:Sheridan Mall\,2225 Erin Mills Parkway\, Mississauga\, ON L5K 1T
 9\, Canada
