SUMMARY: TDSB Learn4Life Summer 2026 Registration Now Open
DESCRIPTION:Learn4Life provides engaging and affordable courses for adult
 s 18+\, including:\n\n· Language classes\n\n· Arts and fitness\n\n· Techn
 ology\n\n· Professional development\n\n· General interest courses\n\nClas
 ses are designed to support lifelong learning\, skill building\, and comm
 unity connection in a welcoming environment.\n\nPlease note:\n\n· Seniors
  receive a 20% discount on course fees\n\n· Subsidy learners receive an 8
 0% discount on course fees\n\n📅 Registration Opened: May 13\, 2026
